Package: guesthouse-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Guesthouse contributors <144541403+s3k000@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: pvg-mesa (= @VERSION@), pvg-dkms (= @VERSION@), weston, foot, fonts-dejavu-core, xkb-data, kbd, mesa-utils, vulkan-tools, glmark2-es2-wayland
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Description: Guesthouse: a weston desktop on the Mac's graphics device
 weston with its GL renderer through our Mesa (Zink on KosmicKrisp), started
 at boot for the account the install made, on the pvg device, at the scale
 the Mac app gives, with the Mac's keyboard layout and foot as its terminal. Says
 "guesthouse: first start ok" on the serial port once it is up after an
 install. The test clients es2gears_wayland, weston-simple-egl, vkcube and
 glmark2-es2-wayland come with it.
